### **Common Mistakes and Traps**

| Mistake | Why Students Make It | Correct Approach / Thinking |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Wrong Pd Configuration** | Assuming it follows the $ns^2$ rule. | Palladium is the specific exception: **$4d^{10} 5s^0$**. |
